    moved_app_specs_preexisting_failures_2026-11-09, 0, "13 specs fail identically at #7931 parent (old or 01_unit path) and at release/1.0.0; not move regressions; evidence table in md"

    moved_app_specs_preexisting_failures_2026-11-09, 1, "2026-11-10 triage: GREEN now: sdoctest_coverage_spec 8/8 (passes on current release); test_runner/types_spec 36/36 (spec-local OutputFormat enum lacked Text, added); test_runner/args_spec 103/103 (timeout default is 900 in product, json format retired and rejected by test_args_validation_error, retired parse test deleted). STILL RED (product/env, not spec-fixable, need higher-model lane): ui/ws_handler_spec 12/14 'expected wrN6TyzDgGJPFsKQw7ZGBsOPOFlFwrLCvsOEw6o= to equal s3pPLMBiTxaQ9kYGzzhZRbK+xOo=' (accept hash digest bytes UTF-8 re-encoded before base64) and 'expected  to equal query-token' (bearer from query); tooling/compile_commands_spec 40/41 'expected compile to equal test.spl'; ui/wm_runtime_bridge_spec 5/6 'expected unpin_app to equal ignored'; test_daemon_mcdc_request_spec 5/8 spawns C:devsimplebinsimple.exe via sh (backslash path lost, rc 127, Windows env defect). Not re-run this pass: browser_render_lane, serial_mcp (parse error app.spl Dedent), sj/forbidden_verbs, test_runner_simple, backend_matrix, session, slang_pack/main."
    moved_app_specs_preexisting_failures_2026-11-09, 2, "2026-11-11 p2-movedapp2 pass 2 (shard log per spec). FIXED (spec-side): compile_commands_spec 41/41 (test named args[2] read args[1]); wm_runtime_bridge_spec 6/6 (right button is pin/unpin by design per sibling test, ignored case now uses middle); test_daemon_mcdc_request_spec 8/8 (SIMPLE_BINARY backslashes stripped by sh, spec now normalises to forward slashes). RE-RUN, STILL RED, product/env, not spec-fixable: browser_render_lane 11/13 (inline style= ignored, expected 150 to equal 200); serial_mcp 0/1 parse error mcp_sdk/server/app.spl Dedent (product, report); sj/forbidden_verbs 23/29 (protected-ref scenarios return true where false expected, product); test_runner_simple 72/74 (function generate_spipe_docs_for_results not found although defined in test_runner_main.spl, import/product); backend_matrix 1/9 in sparse tree (examples/ missing), 7/9 with examples present, 2 remaining are TUI render mismatches (product); ui/session 20/23 (theme isolation/changelog, product); slang_pack/main 4/5 (needs /tmp safetensors fixture, Windows env). ws_handler_spec skipped (other lane)."
    moved_app_specs_preexisting_failures_2026-11-09, 3, "2026-11-11 opus-fix3: serial_mcp_spec 0/17 -> 17/17. Root cause: mcp_sdk/server/app.spl mcp_server_tool_result passed a block-body lambda whose last line closed the call (Err(reason): reason)); seed parser rejects that with 'expected expression, found Dedent' (repro: 3-line take(1, fn(x) -> i64: match ... _: 20) also fails). Fix: single-line lambda + named _app_result_text helper. Parser gap itself NOT fixed (seed Rust parser, needs cargo) - follow-up: accept block lambda closed by trailing paren."
    moved_app_specs_preexisting_failures_2026-11-09, 4, "2026-11-11 opus-fix3: test_runner_simple_spec docgen pair red->green: spec never imported generate_spipe_docs_for_results (test_runner_main) nor TestFileResult (test_runner_types); added both imports. Product export already existed (pub fn)."
    moved_app_specs_preexisting_failures_2026-11-09, 5, "2026-11-11 opus-fix3: forbidden_verbs_spec 23/29 -> 28/28. Spec tested a stale inline copy of check_forbidden that predated protected-ref enforcement; spec now imports production app.sj_daemon.forbidden.check_forbidden. Five legacy cases that contradicted current policy updated (--bookmark main and --via-worktree now denied; message text), duplicate via-worktree case removed. Production check unchanged - it was already correct."
